   "titulo": "«Everything.» changes according to the noun",
   "texto": [
    "**Alle** accompanies people or nouns in plural (**alle foreldrene**, all parents). **Alt** accompanies neutral nouns or is used alone (**alt arbeidet**, all work). **All** accompanies common singular nouns."
